FFmpeg version of headers required to interface with Nvidias codec APIs.

Corresponds to Video Codec SDK version 12.0.16.

VipleStream: include/ffnvcodec/nvEncodeAPI.h was replaced with the Video Codec SDK 13.0 version
(NVENCAPI 13.0) for split-frame encoding (nvenc_split_encode). The dynlink_*.h files are still the
sdk/12.0 ones. By default the NVENC code still talks to the driver with SDK 11.0/12.0 structures,
see the comment at the top of src/nvenc/nvenc_base.cpp.

Minimum required driver versions:
Linux: 520.56.06 or newer
Windows: 522.25 or newer
